 "abilities": {
  "_abilities": "Pulseman's kit (the user's approved design, 2026-10-02): the Voltteccer (running charges it; a jump press while charged launches him as the electric ball, rebounding off everything for a few seconds, an attack throughout), the Volt Shot on Y (tap: a small orb; hold: Mega Man's charge shot, a bigger one), the normal jump in the generic ball. Speeds are 16.16 fixed point.",
  "abilities": [
   "voltteccer",
   "melee"
  ],
  "_voltteccer": "The Voltteccer (tools/voltteccer.py): running at 5 px a frame or more for 75 frames (1.25 s) charges it (a sound; his reds flash his own electric blues: charge_palettes charge1); slower than 2 px a frame on the ground, or a hit, loses it. A jump press while charged launches the electric ball up-forward at 6 px a frame (gravity off) for 180 frames (3 s), rebounding off walls, floors, ceilings and anything that bounces him; an attack throughout and untouchable; then his jump ball with half its speed",
